{#
  Managed by Ansible. Do not edit the rendered file on the host: the next
  playbook run overwrites it. The list of services lives in this role's
  defaults.

  Every comment in this file is a Jinja comment, so none of them reach the
  browser. HTML and CSS comments are served verbatim, and an earlier version
  of this page announced "Managed by Ansible" to anyone who read the source --
  naming the configuration management tool to a passer-by for no reason. The
  rendered page should say nothing beyond the links themselves.

  There is deliberately no heading, no footer and no hostname: the page is
  reachable by anyone who finds the name, and everything else it might say is
  something an attacker would otherwise have to work for.

  Everything is inline and there are no external requests. This page has to
  work when it is the thing being used to find out why something else is not
  working, so it cannot depend on a font host or a CDN being up.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>home</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f6f4;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --ink: #1a1a18;
    --muted: #6b6b66;
    --line: #e2e2dd;
    --accent: #3a6b4f;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #16171a;
      --card: #1e2024;
      --ink: #e8e8e5;
      --muted: #9a9a94;
      --line: #2c2f34;
      --accent: #7fb894;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 16px/1.55 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  main { max-width: 46rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; }
  @media (min-width: 34rem) {
    ul { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  a.tile {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color .15s ease, transform .15s ease;
  }
  a.tile:hover, a.tile:focus-visible {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  a.tile:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .name { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }
  .desc { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.875rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <ul>
{% for link in caddy_homepage_links %}
    <li>
      <a class="tile" href="{{ link.url }}">
        <div class="name">{{ link.name }}</div>
        <div class="desc">{{ link.description }}</div>
      </a>
    </li>
{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</main>
</body>
</html>
